    "preamble": "Virendra vs State Of U.P. on 17 July, 2019 Author: Sudhir Agarwal Bench: Sudhir Agarwal High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 34 Case :- Criminal Revision No. - 1297 of 1991 Revisionist :- Virendra Opposite Party :- State Of U.P. Counsel for Revisionist :- Desh Ratan Chaudhary,Akhilesh Kumar Sharma",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "3. Learned counsel for revisionist contended that punishment of six months rigorous imprisonment with fine of Rs. 1000/- be reduced and in this regard reliance is placed on Supreme Court's decision in Laskari Ram vs. State of H.P., 2001 SCC (Cri) 111 wherein Supreme Court has reduced the Virendra vs State Of U.P. on 17 July, 2019 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/163856905/ 1 imprisonment to three months with fine of Rs. 500/- observing that under Act, 1954 minimum sentence is three months rigorous imprisonment with fine of Rs. 500/-. 4.",
